'''Choppers''' (斧の達人, ''Ono no Tatsujin'', '''Master of the Axe''') is a 3-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 4.0 Update|Version 4.0]].

==Effect==
Unit Attack UP (Sm): Cats' attack power increases by 10%.

